      recibes: 'A decision page with the claim’s evidence level, its survival status, every challenge on record with its date, and what would have to happen for it to move up a level. Sealed, hash-anchored, with a citable ID. Public or private, your call.',
      muestra: 'See a real one: V-0012 →',
      precioH: 'Price',
      precio: 'Claim Screening — US$4,500 · 5 business days.',
      precio2: 'Portfolio Scan — five screenings plus one full diligence report. Separately that is 5 × US$4,500 + US$28,000 = US$50,500; together, US$42,500.',
      ledgerH: 'From the ledger, for you',
      ledger: 'Sixteen advantage claims tracked since 2009. Three still standing. Six eroded under later work. The fastest challenge on record landed two days before the claim was published.',
      ledgerCta: 'Open the survival registry →',
      cierre: 'We do not bill the vendors we judge. That is the whole product.',
    },
  },
  pilots: {
    es: {
      eyebrow: 'Para quien corre un piloto',
      h1: '¿Va a producir mi piloto un número defendible?',
